      "value": "@{62def7db5d872444b3f561e6|full_name} Please open a Canny with a relevant avatar ID if you still know of a case where this isn't working, since we can't investigate further without more information.\n\nAs it's referenced above, please note that a 2000 constraint limit is applied to all avatars as explained here: https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1486-clone-record-playback-system-dosnt-function-correctly",
